{"product":{"id":9952730186016,"title":"Terreno XC Race","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEngineered for blistering speed on smooth, dry hardpack, the Terreno XC Race is the weapon of choice when efficiency and precision define the podium. Purpose-built for cross-country racers, every element of its design delivers one thing: race-winning performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAt the core is a fast-rolling fish scale center tread, minimizing rolling resistance on straightaways while maintaining confident braking and cornering traction when the course demands more. Transitions through turns are seamless, thanks to a gradual progression from the central strip to reinforced shoulder knobs — giving you smooth handling at full tilt.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eThe advanced Race Formulation blends Graphene + Silica for an unbeatable combination of grip, speed, and durability. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrom hammering climbs, to railing descents, to out-of-the saddle sprints,\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e this compound keeps you locked in and charging forward.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e60 TPI nylon Race Casin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eg strikes the perfect balance between suppleness and strength, boosting puncture resistance and absorbing impacts without compromising rolling efficiency. With uniform tread and sidewall deformation, you get predictable handling and peak responsiveness in every section of the course.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe new XC Race construction delivers an exceptional performance upgrade over its predecessor: 20% more speed, 8% more grip, 44% better puncture resistance, and 9% improved riding comfort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"MTB Tire","created_at":"2025-05-20T22:36:58-05:00","handle":"terreno-xc-race","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:26-05:00","published_at":"2025-06-25T06:00:14-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"Cross Country, Discounted products, EP70, IPP40, MTB, Sitewide","variants":[{"id":50200700616992,"product_id":9952730186016,"title":"29x2.25 \/ Brown","price":"106.99","sku":"11A00740","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"29x2.25","option2":"Brown","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-05-20T22:36:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:26-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530035927","grams":660,"image_id":49803866964256,"weight":660.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":50200700584224,"product_id":9952730186016,"title":"29x2.25 \/ Black","price":"106.99","sku":"11A00739","position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"29x2.25","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-05-20T22:36:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:26-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530035910","grams":680,"image_id":49803866997024,"weight":680.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":50200700682528,"product_id":9952730186016,"title":"29x2.4 \/ Brown","price":"106.99","sku":"11A0073